Good, direct works and the ProxyJump was the wrong idea. Simplify your config, replace the a5 block with:

```
Host a5
    HostName 141.61.33.141
    User root
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519
    ServerAliveInterval 30
    ServerAliveCountMax 6
```

No ProxyJump, no ProxyCommand. Fremont keeps its ncat line since it's reached differently.

Then copy the repo. From PowerShell:

```powershell
scp -3 -r fremont:Q3TritonKernel a5:/home/yaolu/
```

Then:

```powershell
ssh a5
```

